R1 after recovery: physical=0 machine.game_intent=1
R1 after acquire+release: physical=1 (was running before acquire), pause calls=1 unpause calls=1
R2 recovery-while-held then release: physical=1 intent=1
R3 register-before-hooks: physical=1 (was running before acquire)
R4 game Pause after external clear: physical=0 intent=1 leases=1 (both want paused)
R5 ownership_available after reporting hooks removed while leased: 1
R6 begin_load failing restore: status=cleanup_incomplete, tracked after=0, physical=1
R7 acquire after shutdown: ok
